# Netlify routing for merry-begonia-4c3cd1 (Jamin Properties web presence).
# /welcome still serves welcome.html; an inline script there upgrades legacy
# share links (?p= / ?ref=) to the branded /s/ and /i/ pages. (Netlify's
# query-param redirect matching proved unreliable on this site, so the upgrade
# is done client-side instead — do not re-add query-matched rules here.)
/welcome    /welcome.html   200
/admin      /admin.html     200
/card       /card.html      200
# Branded share (/s/*) and invite (/i/*) pages are served by the Netlify
# Function netlify/functions/share-page.mjs (routes declared in its config) —
# it restores the text/html content type that Supabase's domain strips.
# Personalized brochures redirect to a PDF, so a plain proxy is fine:
/b/*        https://zmxqozvivdluuxvvcegs.supabase.co/functions/v1/brochure/:splat      200
# Everything else falls back to the Expo web export shell.
/*          /index.html     200
